      "role": "user",
      "content": "old man, i dont mean... i mean, we are in the middle of a siege. there is no \"professional\" to talk to. we are just people in the ruins. everything is just... empty. it feels more like we're already dead, just waiting for the final blow to land. why does it feel like the world is just ending anyway?",
